Description: |
  Representative exemplar of the discovery/ provider extension-point registry, chosen because it
  is both the largest and the architecturally distinct case (persistent watch vs. one-shot poll)
  among the ~22 sibling packages. Confirmed by directly reading kubernetes.go/api.go and
  cross-checking consul.go/ec2.go/gce.go for the shared GetLabels shape.
